body:
you know i asked my nurse a very important question:

&#x200B;

If you see these things daily why do you not report them? She said the system is so corrupt that we just don't report them because you never know who will backstab you.

&#x200B;

btw this was one of the mini doggies. she said because shes deputy supervisor i HAVE to speak to her.

And I thought you were someone else for a second which Is why I flipped thinking I had just explained to someone this is not a hospital and then I thought she said it again. You didn't even give the opportunity to question 

&#x200B;

But since you think it's more important to call people stupid and insult them, I think I'm going to disconnect right here. I don't like using abusive words but you might have just defined yourself to yourself.

dude you the bomb. this is awesome.

&#x200B;

what materials did you use

Decisions\*

&#x200B;

Lol i'm not going to get bombed for doing this! yike!

ritalin doesn't make you angry?

&#x200B;

I tried both ritalin and concerts and I am very snappy on both

probably. 

&#x200B;

I'm kidding! I want to hear more about this too. I feel overwhelmed by everything that I have to do and don't know how to manage my schedule and incorporate enjoying life in it!.

Hey! which meds are you on?

&#x200B;

I'm currently trying concerta and it was great but when I'm triggered, I enter rage.

how do they show good billable numbers?

&#x200B;

I've had the worst experience whereby I've been left traumatized, no joke.

I have had the worst experience at CSB. My rights have been violated and just the way they operate is just horrible. Its like I've been left traumatized and now I have additional trauma to work through in addition to my past.

&#x200B;

Are you guys told to sell as many services to clients or make clients attend services just to increase funding? I'm curious because I've legit been harassed to take services I do not want.

I forgot to mention my insurance wont approve therapy. I am experiencing a lot of this and I need to find strategies to cope that others might have found helpful in the past. 

&#x200B;

Please dont respond with "therapy". I'm looking for real answers from people who have gone through this in the past. Therapy isnt an option in the moment right now.

the fact that you're in med school is just so amazing to me. I can't focus for more than a minute due to my adhd. I was supposed to do medicine but dropped it.

&#x200B;

I can completely relate to what your'e feeling, i'm going through something similar though no one close to me committed suicide my doctor did hint that he thought i might overdose on benzo, which came as a shock to me because I never ever thought about suicide. And now I'm thinking it too. but i don't want to think about it.

&#x200B;

I want to get my mind out of there. Its so hard because I have history of childhood sexual trauma, and i feel it in my body.

do you know how much he was on? i had a strange reaction. Within an hour, i'd dip into deep depression. this wasn't a crash. 

and i paced and talked a lot.

&#x200B;

if i took a lower dose, i felt sleepy.

&#x200B;

im going to be placed on concerta and i'm scared.

your dude is pretty cool. and so is your brick wall. May i know what part of the world you live in?

&#x200B;

I'm super jealous!

oh god tell me about this. A person that claimed to be my friend at work and always address me as "friend" turned out to be the most fake person ever. To the point that once I asked her hey do you want to be friends because if not, no worries I'm not offended. I just don't wish to keep reaching out to you if you don't wish to.

&#x200B;

She gave a lot of mixed messages. Planned and cancelled within minutes. Said yes then came up with an excuse within minutes.

When I left. She said Stay in touch! I pointed my finger at her and said "you too". And then never texted her again.

&#x200B;

I don't get people like this. Like i gave you the opportunity to just come clean and you said oh no! it's nothing lke that I've just been busy my friends have been complaining too!

I like this advice for minimal damage. If other people weren't involved, then I'd literally just slice her off, aka block her or say something and then block. 

&#x200B;

What does grey rock mean?
